BtcMole License
===============

You are free to use this program at no cost to search for any of your
own forgotten Bitcoin wallets — that is, wallets for which you already
know your own P2PKH address and an approximate key range.

If you solve any of the Bitcoin Puzzles numbered 71 through 160 using
BtcMole's brute-force mode (bf), you must pay the program's author 20%
of the value of the solved puzzle. This commission applies only to bf.
Arrange payment directly with the author on Telegram (@keymole).

The dig and jump modes are governed by the rules of the pool.

If you are interested in an unrestricted personal version of BtcMole,
contact the author on Telegram (@keymole).

No warranty of any kind is provided. The program is supplied "as is";
the author is not liable for any losses or damages arising from its
use.
